    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont know how to explain it. everything looks fine on paper. i have a good job, my parents are happy, i have a place to live... but i just feel so incredibly empty. like there is this huge gray fog over everything and i cant feel anything. i feel like a fraud because i have no reason to be this miserable.",
